  "reasoning": "The defendant, while holding a village committee leadership position, abused his official duties to submit false application materials for a rural dilapidated house reconstruction program, knowing his house did not meet the eligibility criteria, and obtained a government subsidy of 16,000 RMB. This conduct fits the crime of abusing official duties for personal gain (徇私舞弊), similar to the earlier example where a quarantine officer falsified documents to obtain subsidies. The primary criminal charge is therefore 徇私舞弊.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]徇私舞弊<eoa>"
}
